
@startuml 06_LevelService

title 6. LevelService - 레벨 잠금 해제 및 클리어 결과 기록

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

enum LevelUnlockState {
  Locked
  Unlocked
  Cleared
}

enum LevelGoalType {
  CollectGems
  ReachTargetScore
  ClearObstacles
}

class Level {
  - LevelId: Guid
  - ZoneId: Guid
  - LevelNumber: int
  - UnlockState: LevelUnlockState
  - BestStarsEarned: int
  - HighestScore: int
  - MaxMovesAllowed: int
  - GoalType: LevelGoalType
  - GoalIconImageCode: string
  - GoalTargetAmount: int
  + UnlockThisLevel(): void
  + RecordClearResult(finalScore: int, starsEarned: int): void
  + IsCurrentlyLocked(): bool
}

interface LevelRepository {
  + FindLevelsByZoneId(zoneId: Guid): Task<List<Level>>
  + FindLevelById(levelId: Guid): Task<Level>
  + SaveLevel(level: Level): Task
}

interface LevelService {
  + ListLevelsInZone(zoneId: Guid): Result<List<Level>, ServiceError>
  + UnlockNextLevel(zoneId: Guid, justClearedLevelId: Guid): Result<Level, ServiceError>
  + RecordLevelClearResult(levelId: Guid, finalScore: int, starsEarned: int): Result<Level, ServiceError>
}

class ServiceError <<see 00_CommonTypes>>

Level ..> LevelUnlockState
Level ..> LevelGoalType

LevelService ..> LevelRepository : Task<T> 결과를 기다림(await)
LevelService ..> Level
LevelRepository ..> Level
LevelService ..> ServiceError : 실패 시 반환

note right of LevelService
  판정 규칙: UnlockNextLevel은 같은 존 안의 바로 이전 레벨이
  Cleared 상태가 아니면 LevelIsLocked 실패.
  게임을 이겼을 때 GameSessionService가 이 서비스를 호출함.
end note

@enduml
